            <ArticleTitle>A novel technique for catheter engagement of protruding aorto-ostial stent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1093-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/ccd.25274</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case of stenoses in the right coronary artery with a previously deployed stent showing gross protrusion into the aorta. Despite difficulty in cannulation of a guiding catheter into the coronary artery, percutaneous intervention was accomplished using a novel technique to engage the protruding stent.</AbstractText>
